# Datasets & derived data — NEVER commit.
# Reasons: OPP-115/MAPP/APP-350 are CC BY-NC (no redistribution); large; and fully regenerable from
# the download + our seeded scripts. Recreate empty dirs after clone with `python scaffold.py`.
# (Comments must be on their OWN line — inline "# ..." after a pattern is treated as part of the pattern.)
data/external/
data/aa/raw/
data/ner_bio/
# LS import scaffold embeds the scraped doc text (regenerable via `ls_import_export make-tasks`)
data/aa/annotated/ls_import_tasks.json
# Label Studio EXPORTS + adjudicated gold embed the full scraped doc text too — do NOT commit them
# (same no-redistribution rule as data/aa/raw/). The safe provenance is results/annotation/kappa.json,
# which has only doc_id + counts + kappa (no text) and IS committed.
data/aa/annotated/[Ee]xport*.json
data/aa/annotated/[Gg]old.json
# Per-document agreement diffs quote the annotated phrases from the scraped docs.
# summary.csv + report.md (numbers only) ARE committed.
results/annotation/agreement/docs/
results/annotation/audit/per_doc/
# Adjudication worklists quote span text -> ignored. proposed_gold/ is ALSO ignored: it is a
# machine-merged snapshot derived from the FAILED round-1 annotation (kappa 0.28) and must never be
# mistaken for the real answer key. Commit it only once it is regenerated from the round-2 exports.
# worklist.md (counts only) IS committed.
results/annotation/adjudication/worklist/
results/annotation/adjudication/proposed_gold/
# Per-annotator fix lists quote span text; fixlist/README.md (counts only) IS committed.
results/annotation/fixlist/P*/
# Synthetic consent artefacts are regenerable (fixed seed) via `gen_consent_artefacts.py`.
# The 2 REAL examples + README + schema in data/aa/consent_artefacts/ ARE committed (reference fixtures).
data/aa/consent_artefacts/synthetic/
# Summarizer datasets: train/test are regenerable via `summ.make_dataset`; gold_refs.jsonl (P1/P4's
# handwritten summaries + gold facts — team's own work, no raw scraped text) IS committed.
data/summ/train.jsonl
data/summ/test.jsonl
data/summ/preds.jsonl

# COMMITTED (team's own work, needed for collaboration in this private repo, tracked by default):
#   data/aa/annotated/ (except exports/gold/import above)   data/aa/consent_artefacts/ (except synthetic/)
#   data/summ/gold_refs.jsonl   data/splits/   results/   contracts/ (address+ABI, NOT .env)

# Node (Phase 4)
node_modules/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
